    <string name="a11y_label">Parda checkout shield</string>
    <string name="a11y_description">Parda reads checkout screens on this phone to spot pre-ticked add-ons, last-step fees, fake timers and guilt-worded buttons. It never taps Pay, and it has no internet permission, so nothing it reads can leave the device. When you choose Mask with Parda on a web page, it pastes the masked copy into that same box.</string>
